        <mxCell id="box2" value="&lt;b style=&quot;font-size:22px&quot;&gt;첨부파일 · 출발 저장소&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;논리 객체 ID · 버전 · 멱등 키&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;크기 · 전체 내용 checksum · 변경 경계&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:18px;color:#64748b&quot;&gt;확정 · 교체 · 삭제 · 진행 중 업로드&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=10;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#cbd0dc;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=20;spacingRight=14;fontColor=#0f172a;fontFamily=Arial;" vertex="1" parent="1">
